<title>USA: Orion group cuts Earl Scheib stake.</title>
<headline>Orion group cuts Earl Scheib stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Orion Capital Corp said Thursday it reduced its stake in Earl Scheib Inc to 6.0 percent or 274,300 capital stock.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold 56,000 capital stock between August 30 and September 13 at prices ranging from $7.95 to $8.71 a share.</p>
</text>
